Subject: [PATCH 1859/3799] soh: rename func_80AED6DC -> EnRu1_RecordRoom

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: records the room Ruto is currently in and resets her carry offset.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c
index 6c755d997..6d8c6e3fe 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Ru1/z_en_ru1.c
@@ -1383,7 +1383,8 @@ s32 EnRu1_CheckRoomAndWater(EnRu1* this, PlayState* play) {
     return true;
 }
 
-void func_80AED6DC(EnRu1* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AED6DC: records the room Ruto is currently in and resets her carry offset.
+void EnRu1_RecordRoom(EnRu1* this, PlayState* play) {
     s8 curRoomNum = play->roomCtx.curRoom.num;
 
     this->roomNum2 = curRoomNum;
